+ The wigley hull specifications are according to 

 "Experiments and Calculations on 4 Wigley Hull Forms in Head Waves"
  J.M.J. Journée, Delft University of Technology

 \eta = (1-\zeta^2)(1-\xi^2)(1+a_2*\xi^2 + a_4*\xi^4) + \alpha*\zeta^2*(1-\zeta^8)(1-\xi^2)^4

+ The wigley hull in this folder has the following characteristics:

model name: riggs
a_2   = 0
a_4   = 0
alpha = 0
L/B   = 10
L/T   = 400/9

+ The grid is for the computations according to:

"Two benchmark problems for three-dimensional, linear hydroelasticity" by 
Riggs H R, Niimi K M, Huang L L.
Journal of Offshore Mechanics and Arctic Engineering, 2007
doi: 10.1115/1.2746397

+ NOTE: The grid is built for L = 1 m.

+ To generate the grid run the scripts as:

$Overture/bin/rap rap_whole
$Overture/bin/mbuilder hype_whole
$Overture/bin/ogen overlap

+ To build the grid without plotting run the script ./build_grid_noplot

+ The grid has been built by Baoshun Zhou
